   "id": "claude-3",
   "x": 2940,
   "y": 4460,
   "w": 400,
   "color": "blue",
   "text": "During a lock the iPhone's internet is cut by the VPN. To still hear 'open' from the Mac, the tunnel has to let local Wi-Fi through (and the tunnel itself checks iCloud).",
